&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Steve Tidwell - Senior Manager, Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steve has been in the tech industry for over two decades, working in global IT operations and management, corporate IT, networking, data center, and cloud-based platforms. Prior to joining Cockroach Labs a little over a year ago, he worked at Crunchyroll, Venturebeat, and Conviva, among others. His experience runs the gamut from building on-prem installations, to migrating those to the cloud, to his current primary focus on large-scale cloud-based distributed systems. During his free time he enjoys writing technical blog posts, reading science fiction, cooking, and gardening.&lt;/p&gt;
